Z||000023||MikeSchaefer||03-01-2001||12:03 PM||||Hi,<BR>Didn't know anyone from around here was on the list.  I drive the white 84 w/out a spoiler.  There is another white fiero in town (85 Gt), that used to be mine, but is now my roommates.  Lets see, the red is an 86 SE and is Emily Barkers, and there is a Black 86 base coupe in town that is my x-girlfriend's car.  Yeah we definately should get together sometime.  I'm at school right now (ISU), but will be back for spring break in a couple of weeks, I'm planning on getting my spoiler put on over break.  Do you know Dave Barker?  I think I'll be at his shop a lot over break with my car.  Oh, I used to drive the red Delorean that was in town, but am selling it right now.  What color is your 84, maybe I've seen it?<BR>Later,<BR>Mike Schaefer <A HREF="http://surf.to/fiero" TARGET=_blank>http://surf.to/fiero</A> ||||reg||14
Z||000024||bya72||03-01-2001||12:30 PM||||My 84 is a really faded red and the headlights are stuck in the up position.  If you drove through Kappa in the fall you might have seen it in the driveway.  Now it is either in the garage or the building in back depending on what I am driving to work.  On the bad weather days the jeep gets to play.<P>I really don't know anyone in town.  Is the shop where the Delorian was sitting for a while?  <P>So what kind of spare parts do you have?  I need seats, gear shift boot, everything for the emergency brake, some knowledge on how to repair fiberglass, paint job, and a buch of little things.  I know what I am doing on the Jeep but not the Fiero.<P>Just let me know when you are back in town.  I am a teacher up north a little so my weekends are free.  I also graduated from ISU in 96.||||reg||1
